{"strongs": "H6236", "word": "עֲשַׂר", "translit": "a.sar", "root": "", "morph": "A:N", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "a ten", "definition": "עֲשַׂר , עַשְׂרָה noun masculine and feminine a ten (see Biblical Hebrew); — masculine (following feminine noun ) Dan 7:7 ; Dan 7:20 ; Dan 7:24 feminine (before masculine noun ) v Dan 7:24 תְּרֵי עֲשַׂר = twelve (following masculine noun ) Dan 4:26 ; Ezra 6:17 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9801')\">BDB9801</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6236')\">H6236</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H6235')\">H6235</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9800')\">BDB9800</entry> | BIBLICAL ARAMAIC | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9802')\">BDB9802</entry></div><p> <bdbarc>עֲשַׂר</bdbarc>, <bdbarc>עַשְׂרָה</bdbarc> <b>noun masculine</b> and <b>feminine</b> <highlightword>a ten</highlightword> (see Biblical Hebrew); — masculine (following <b>feminine noun</b>) <ref ref=\"Dan 7:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,7)\">Dan 7:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 7:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,20)\">Dan 7:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 7:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,24)\">Dan 7:24</ref> <b>feminine</b> (before <b>masculine noun</b>) v<ref ref=\"Dan 7:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,24)\">Dan 7:24</ref> <bdbarc>תְּרֵי עֲשַׂר</bdbarc> = <highlight>twelve</highlight> (following <b>masculine noun</b>) <ref ref=\"Dan 4:26\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,26)\">Dan 4:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:17\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,17)\">Ezra 6:17</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Dan 7:7", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 7, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Dan 7:20", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 7, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Dan 7:24", "book": "DAN", "c